# Plataforma Agéntica de Datos

**Stack:** Python 3.11, FastAPI, LangGraph, PostgreSQL 16, Redis 7, Docker Compose

---

## Quickstart

```bash
# 1. Configurar entorno
cp .env.example .env
# Editar .env con tus secrets (JWT_SECRET, API keys, etc.)

# 2. Levantar todo
docker compose up -d

# 3. Verificar
curl http://localhost:8000/health/ready
# → {"status":"ready"}

# 4. Documentación API
open http://localhost:8000/docs
```

---

## Arquitectura (4 Capas)

| Capa | Componentes | Tech |
|------|-------------|------|
| **Ingesta** | Connector Registry, Rate Limiter, Redis Queue | Plugin system, Redis Streams |
| **ETL** | ETL Agent (LangGraph), Feature Store | PostgreSQL + JSONB, Great Expectations |
| **Análisis** | SQL, Python, Viz, Insight Agents | LangGraph fan-out, pandas/Plotly |
| **Activación** | Dashboard API, Alert Engine, Reports | FastAPI, HTML artifacts |

**Orquestación:** LangGraph (stateful DAG, checkpoints, retry, visualización)

---

## Estructura del Proyecto

```
data_platform/
├── api/              # FastAPI Gateway + routes
├── orchestrator/     # LangGraph pipeline + nodes
├── agents/           # SQL, Python, Viz, Insight
├── connectors/       # Plugins: Stripe, PG, CSV, HTTP
├── core/             # Config, DB, Redis, Auth, Obs
├── models/           # SQLAlchemy models
├── schemas/          # Pydantic contracts
└── plugins/          # Registry entry points
```

---

## Endpoints Principales

| Método | Path | Descripción |
|--------|------|-------------|
| `POST` | `/sources` | Registrar source (API, CSV, DB, Scrap) |
| `POST` | `/sources/{id}/ingest` | Trigger ingesta manual |
| `GET` | `/pipelines/{run_id}` | Estado + métricas del run |
| `GET` | `/pipelines/{run_id}/results` | Resultados análisis consolidados |
| `POST` | `/analysis/sql` | Query ad-hoc SQL Agent |
| `POST` | `/analysis/python` | Código ad-hoc Python Agent |
| `GET` | `/dashboards/{id}` | Dashboard HTML renderizado |
| `GET` | `/health/ready` | Readiness probe |

---

## Configuración de Source (Ejemplo)

```json
POST /sources
{
  "source_id": "stripe_charges",
  "type": "api",
  "config": {
    "base_url": "https://api.stripe.com/v1",
    "auth": {"type": "bearer", "secret_ref": "stripe_key"},
    "endpoint": "/charges",
    "params": {"limit": 100, "created[gt]": "{{last_run}}"},
    "pagination": "cursor",
    "rate_limit": {"requests": 100, "window_seconds": 60}
  },
  "schedule": "0 */6 * * *"
}
```

---

## Agentes Implementados

| Agente | Capacidad | Output |
|--------|-----------|--------|
| **SQL Agent** | Queries parametrizadas, EXPLAIN ANALYZE | Tabla + plan |
| **Python Agent** | Pandas, scikit-learn, statsmodels | DataFrame + métricas |
| **Viz Agent** | Plotly/Altair → HTML interactivo | Artifact HTML |
| **Insight Agent** | Anomalías (IsolationForest), narrativas | JSON + texto |

---

## Observabilidad

| Pilar | Implementación |
|-------|----------------|
| **Logs** | JSON estructurado (service, trace_id, event, metrics) |
| **Métricas** | Prometheus (latency, throughput, errors, DLQ, tokens) |
| **Tracing** | Jaeger (trace por pipeline_run_id, spans por agente) |
| **Health** | `/health/live` + `/health/ready` por servicio |

---

## Testing

```bash
# Unit + Integration
pytest --cov=data_platform --cov-fail-under=80

# Solo unit
pytest tests/unit -v

# Load test (10k events/min)
locust -f tests/load/locustfile.py --host=http://localhost:8000
```

---

## Decisiones Clave (Para Defensa)

| Decisión | Justificación |
|----------|---------------|
| **LangGraph** | Estado persistente, checkpoints automáticos, DAG visualizable, human-in-loop nativo |
| **Redis Streams** | Sin deps extra, consumer groups, backpressure, replay para debugging |
| **PostgreSQL + JSONB** | ACID, una sola BD operacional, schemas flexibles, pgvector/timescale futuros |
| **Plugin System** | `entry_points` - nuevos conectores/agentes sin tocar core |
| **Async Queue** | Desacopla capas, escala workers independientemente, resiliencia |

---

## Variables de Entorno Requeridas

```bash
# .env
JWT_SECRET=your-secret
JWT_PUBLIC_KEY=-----BEGIN PUBLIC KEY-----\n...\n-----END PUBLIC KEY-----
DATABASE_URL=postgresql+asyncpg://user:pass@postgres:5432/platform
REDIS_URL=redis://redis:6379/0
STRIPE_API_KEY=sk_test_...
GITHUB_TOKEN=ghp_...
```

